{"2962990": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "You Are Dead", "steam_appid": 2962990, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Consciousness...  Where? Unknown. Who are all these dudes in robes? Only one way forward: through the door.</strong><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962990/extras/86d898237eef3e4084e96e33722a79d4.avif?t=1778859146\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the afterlife’s strangest waiting room, where each run reshapes the world, the dangers, and your very questionable chances of survival. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step pushes you closer to the truth of why you are here, and what this place wants from you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You Are Dead is a roguelite twin-stick shooter with a relaxed pace, retro feel, and a fondness for the odd and curious. Combat is fast when it needs to be, but with as much emphasis on atmosphere and personality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet creatures that range from charming to deeply irritating. Find weapons infused with questionable magic. Gather strange effects that can help, hurt, or quietly complicate everything. Die and die again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962990/extras/892fe5e369d9cca2501269c45886aba4.avif?t=1778859146\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• A strange, cozy afterlife full of weird characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Weapons that evolve from useful to slightly unhinged</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Persistent unlocks that reshape future attempts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Retro visuals, chill music, and intentional pacing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Controller or mouse and keyboard support</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Encounters designed to be learned, not rushed</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Creative problem solving (cheese encouraged)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You Are Dead</strong> keeps growing with new features and content. Step through the door again and see what the afterlife serves you next.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Consciousness...  Where? Unknown. Who are all these dudes in robes? Only one way forward: through the door.</strong><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962990/extras/86d898237eef3e4084e96e33722a79d4.avif?t=1778859146\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the afterlife’s strangest waiting room, where each run reshapes the world, the dangers, and your very questionable chances of survival. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step pushes you closer to the truth of why you are here, and what this place wants from you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You Are Dead is a roguelite twin-stick shooter with a relaxed pace, retro feel, and a fondness for the odd and curious. Combat is fast when it needs to be, but with as much emphasis on atmosphere and personality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet creatures that range from charming to deeply irritating. Find weapons infused with questionable magic. Gather strange effects that can help, hurt, or quietly complicate everything. Die and die again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962990/extras/892fe5e369d9cca2501269c45886aba4.avif?